&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect with the TAP for a Preliminary Phone Screening&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet with your Hiring Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Deep Dive&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Case Study&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with Senior Leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
