&lt;p&gt;Cohere Health’s innovations continue to receive industry-wide recognition. We’ve been recognized on TIME’s World Top HealthTech Companies 2025 list, the 2025 Inc. 5000 list, in the Gartner® Hype Cycle™ for U.S. Healthcare Payers (2022-2025), and ranked as a Top 5 LinkedIn™ Startup for 2023 &amp;amp; 2024.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We can’t wait to learn more about you and meet you at ZignaAI, a Cohere Health company!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
