&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opportunity Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As DevOps and Site Reliability Engineer (SRE), you’ll be part of the action - working closely with application teams to automate / optimize infrastructure, and solve issues in an exciting, fast-paced environment. You’ll play a vital role in ensuring that our systems are reliable, scalable, and high-performing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You would design, implement, and manage robust observability solutions across our cloud infrastructure and applications. The ideal candidate will have hands-on experience with Prometheus, Grafana, AWS Cloud Monitoring, Datadog. You should be comfortable working with metrics, logs, and traces, and be able to correlate telemetry data to proactively detect, diagnose, and resolve issues.&lt;/p&gt;
