&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, strategically oriented leadership role embedded within our Clinical Operations and Commercial organizations. The right candidate brings sharp analytical instincts, a bias for action, strong business partnering capabilities, and the ability to deliver reliable financial leadership at a pace that keeps up with a fast-moving commercial business. Beyond technical finance execution, this role requires someone who can act as a trusted business partner - working closely with internal stakeholders to influence decisions, shape strategy, and drive financial accountability across functions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
