&lt;li&gt;Own headcount management reporting across Clinical Ops and Commercial teams - tracking actuals, performing detailed actual vs. plan variance analysis, identifying root causes, quantifying impacts, and presenting clear narratives to leadership with speed and precision&lt;/li&gt;
