&lt;li&gt;Conduct ROI and cost-impact analysis on process improvements, product changes, and new initiatives - providing data-driven recommendations that guide spend decisions and resource allocation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted financial advisor to Clinical Operations and Commercial leadership - proactively identifying financial risks, opportunities, and trade-offs that inform strategic business decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain dynamic financial models using Adaptive Insights (Workday Adaptive Planning) to manage planning cycles, scenario modeling, and real-time financial reporting with efficiency and accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI-powered tools and automation to streamline recurring analysis, surface insights faster, and continuously elevate the speed and quality of financial deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and nurture strong cross-functional relationships with internal stakeholders, ensuring finance is embedded in key operational and commercial discussions rather than operating as a back-office function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex financial data into strategic narratives that enable stakeholders to act with confidence and clarity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion a culture of financial discipline, proactive ownership, and data-driven decision-making across partnered functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role calls for a high standard of work and a genuine commitment to getting things right. We value people who take pride in what they produce and bring both care and urgency to everything they do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-quality deliverables - we value work that is thorough, well-presented, and something you are proud to put your name on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Speed without sacrificing accuracy - the ability to turn around analysis quickly while maintaining rigor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive ownership - you anticipate needs, flag issues early, and drive resolution without being asked&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability and responsiveness during East Coast US hours, including overlap for leadership calls, planning sessions, and ad hoc requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A continuous improvement mindset - always looking for ways to do things better, faster, and smarter&lt;/li&gt;
