&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Finance, Accounting, Economics, or a related field; MBA or CPA/ICAI a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7–9 years of FP&amp;amp;A, commercial finance, or operations finance experience; healthcare, life sciences, or services industry background preferred&lt;/li&gt;
