&lt;li&gt;Consult Platform-as-a-Service (PaaS) clients on designing an optimal decision automation program that maximizes platform value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex client requirements into a detailed technical blueprints for development teams to leverage when implementing new clients&lt;/li&gt;
