&lt;li&gt;8+ years experience working in a client facing role; Demonstrated expertise in building client relationships and driving client engagement, value, and satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of healthcare systems, medical terminologies, clinical workflows, and regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate ethical dilemmas in healthcare data management and analysis while upholding professional standards and integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Proficiency in Excel and PowerPoint;&amp;nbsp;Proficiency with building and/or maintaining dashboards in self-service business intelligence tools such as Tableau or PowerBI; Proficiency with using SQL to extract insights from complex healthcare data sets&lt;/li&gt;
