&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Manager of Marketing Operations in India and collaborating closely with the Demand Generation team in the US, you will sit at the intersection of process, people, and technology. Your responsibilities will include campaign execution, AI-enabled workflows, KPI reporting, project coordination, and process documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
