&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate the highest level of professionalism, accountability, and service in your interactions with Cohere teammates and providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support projects specific to building the team&#39;s clinical expertise and efficiency, as delegated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the team on operational improvements and member/provider experience involving clinical review tasks, as delegated&lt;/li&gt;
