&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master&#39;s degree in commerce, business administration, accounting, finance, MBA - HR, Finance, PGDM in HR or related field with a demonstrated high level of academic success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of payroll processing experience&lt;/li&gt;
