&lt;li&gt;Experience with U.S. payroll, including federal and multi-state requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing a payroll team of at least two members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with benefits processing, including 401k and health insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work under regular deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle sensitive employee data securely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
