&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opportunity Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cohere Health is seeking a highly analytical, resourceful, and organized &lt;strong&gt;Business Development &amp;amp; Sales Operations Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; to support our growing Growth organization. This role sits at the intersection of business development, sales operations, data analysis, market intelligence, and process improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is naturally curious, comfortable working with data, and able to turn information into actionable insights. This person will support Sales and Growth leadership through account and market research, reporting and analysis, CRM data management, business intelligence, and operational projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on role for someone who enjoys solving problems, learning new tools, working across teams, and using technology and AI to make teams more efficient and effective.&lt;/p&gt;
