&lt;li&gt;Research and map key stakeholders and buying committees within target accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor company news, earnings, leadership changes, partnerships, and other developments relevant to Sales and Growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI and other research tools to efficiently gather, analyze, and synthesize information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and track competitor use in target accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package research and insights into concise, actionable outputs for Sales, Solutions, Marketing, and leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; CRM Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain high-quality account, contact, opportunity, and other sales data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research, validate, enrich, and clean CRM data and identify data-quality issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support data governance and help ensure consistent use of sales processes and CRM standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting, Analytics &amp;amp; Business Insights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze sales pipeline, activity, funnel performance, account engagement, and other key business development metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain Salesforce reports and dashboards that provide actionable insights to Sales and Growth leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor trends, identify gaps and opportunities, and help translate data into recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support analysis of BDR performance, meeting generation, opportunity conversion, and pipeline contribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct account and territory analysis to help prioritize prospects and focus sales resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop recurring KPI reports and support Quarterly Business Reviews and executive reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform ad hoc analyses using Salesforce, Google Sheets, Excel, and other reporting tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Operations &amp;amp; Process Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support day-to-day Sales Operations activities and cross-functional operational initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to streamline processes, eliminate manual work, and improve sales productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support workflow improvements, automation, and implementation of new processes and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales, Marketing, Solutions, and other teams to gather requirements and deliver operational solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI, Automation &amp;amp; Productivity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI tools such as CohereGPT and Claude to improve research, analysis, reporting, and productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to automate repetitive research, reporting, and operational processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiment with emerging AI capabilities and help develop scalable workflows that improve team efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Business Development Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support BDR, Sales, Marketing, and Solutions teams with account research, prospect identification, contact research, and account prioritization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with event and conference research, target-account development, and other prospecting initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate prospect and account information and support effective handoffs between Business Development and Sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
