&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 years of experience in healthcare analytics, cost containment, or similar roles in the healthcare industry, preferably within a payer, provider, or managed care setting,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in data analytics and visualization tools, for example SQL, Tableau, Power BI, advanced Excel,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of healthcare cost drivers and medical claims data,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in data cleaning, data analysis and problem-solving skills,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to transform complex data into actionable insights and clear, concise reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bonus:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with prior authorization, utilization management processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in R, SQL, Python, Scala, AWS (S3, Airflow, Athena, Spark)&lt;/li&gt;
