&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Healthcare Management, Business Administration, Public Health, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master&#39;s degree in Speech-Language Pathology, Communication Sciences and Disorders, Healthcare Administration, Public Health, or a related field preferred. Licensed Speech-Language Pathologist (SLP) with ASHA Certificate of Clinical Competence (CCC-SLP) strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
