&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication; skilled at presenting findings to diverse stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative, proactive, and adaptable; comfortable operating in a matrixed environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with healthcare regulations, payer operations, and value-based care models preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
