&lt;p&gt;This is a remote-first role that may require travel to Boston, MA for new hire onboarding and occasional in-person team meetings and company events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
