&lt;li&gt;12+ years in the software development lifecycle, with progression to complex, high-impact cloud-native system design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in auth/authz frameworks, secure API design, access control, and automated testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong system design, observability, and production operations skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fullstack expertise in modern languages, event-driven systems, and CI/CD; IaC a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing data systems/pipelines for analytical and AI workloads, with strong data modeling fundamentals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record shaping engineering standards, mentoring engineers, and communicating strategy across technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI architectures (multi-agent, RAG, evaluation frameworks) a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthcare tech, health plan, or Payment Integrity experience a plus; Healthcare interoperability standards and clinical ontologies a plus&lt;/li&gt;
